# templates/AGENTS.md and .github/ are deliberate, tracked parts of this
# project. Some environments globally ignore them (AGENTS.md as an
# installer-managed artifact, **/.github/ wholesale); repo-level negation
# takes precedence over a user's core.excludesFile. scripts/lint.py's
# tracked-files check guards against this class regressing silently.
!AGENTS.md
!.github/
!.github/**

# editor droppings
*.swp
*.swo
*~
